WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,130
Didn't expect it to be so soon

2
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:07,290
Did you know that people have visited your hometown?

3
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:08,570
Someone is coming from my hometown

4
00:00:08,570 --> 00:00:10,780
What Section Chief Gao said is

5
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:13,340
Qin Youlu took several young people with him

6
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,120
I want to come here and ruin you

7
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,680
I saw through it at a glance

8
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:18,460
Just pink eye

9
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:20,260
You are our treasure

10
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:24,520
I can let blind people engage in production sabotage

11
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:27,320
I asked the security department to put them in the guild room.

12
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,120
Hungry for 24 hours

13
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:30,660
He was released only after writing a guarantee letter

14
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:31,940
No matter how dishonest you are

15
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,480
We will notify the commune immediately

16
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:37,080
Pursuing them for disturbing public order and affecting production

17
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,360
Brother Gao

18
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:40,560
I remember this love

19
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:45,600
Which of us has a trivial matter with whom?

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:48,510
Bear's paw is there

21
00:00:48,510 --> 00:00:50,030
Four intact bear paws

22
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:51,310
A whole black bear

23
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:53,680
Six to seven hundred pounds of clean meat

24
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:54,700
you alone

25
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:57,010
Not injured?

26
00:00:57,010 --> 00:00:58,030
good luck

27
00:00:58,030 --> 00:00:59,830
If you encounter a bear or a pack of wolves, both sides will suffer losses.
